The Panel MCP Server has been substantially rewritten and extended:
factory-pattern tool registry, central validated dispatch, async
background tasks with durable state, parallel panel orchestration with
adversarial debate, OAuth-to-API fallback, observable streaming via
SQLite execution graph + live web viewer, and Anthropic provider
integration.

For the full list of changes relative to upstream, see the git log
since the fork point at commit f54ff97.
